    <div class="faq_light" data-module="faq_light" unic="eed51349-8d1f-987f">

        <div>
            <!-- faq-screen -->
            <section class="faq-screen screen">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">

                        <div class="accordion-menu" id="accordion-menu-2">
                            <div class="li-point open">
                                <div class="dropdownlink">
                                    <i class="arrow arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    <div class="fw-medium title">
                                        <span>
                                            <h3 class="faq-screen__question-title">How Does Semrush's Free Trial Work?</h3>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="submenuItems" style="display: block;">
                                    <span>
                                        <p>
                                            The majority of our toolkits come with a 7-day free trial, so you can test the tools and see how they work.
                                        </p>
                                        <p>
                                            You can activate trials for different toolkits at the same time. Each toolkit trial is available once per account.
                                        </p>
                                        <p>
                                            Here’s what you can try for free:
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    Semrush One: This trial combines the SEO Toolkit with the AI Visibility Toolkit to give you a complete solution for winning on search everywhere—from traditional search to AI discovery. <a href="https://www.semrush.com/signup/?src=lp-trial-page&custom=ai-seo&trial=force&redirect_to=%2Fseo%2F" target="blank">Take a Semrush One trial here.</a>
                                                </li>
                                                <li>SEO, Traffic & Market, Social, Content, Local, and Advertising Toolkits: 7-day free trial for all plans.</li>
                                                <li>AI Visibility Toolkit: No trial, but you can explore a <a
                                                    href="https://www.semrush.com/semrush-ai-toolkit/" target="blank">free demo report</a>.</li>
                                                <li>Reporting and Lead Generation Add-ons: 14-day free trial.</li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </p>  
                                        <p>  
                                            Learn more about our trial limits <a
                                            href="https://www.semrush.com/kb/1011-subscriptions" target="blank">here</a>.
                                        </p>
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="li-point">
                                <div class="dropdownlink">
                                    <div class="fw-medium title">
                                        <span>
                                            <h3 class="faq-screen__question-title">Can You Cancel Your Semrush Subscription After the Free Trial?</h3>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <i class="arrow arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div class="submenuItems" style="display: none;">
                                    <span>
                                        <p>Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time. Before you do, we'd love
